graph LR
    Client[Client app] -->|X-Api-Key| APIGW[API Gateway REST]

    subgraph AWS["AWS Cloud"]
        APIGW -->|authorize| Auth[Lambda: authorizer]
        APIGW -->|POST/GET /documents| Api[Lambda: apiHandler]

        subgraph VPC["VPC, isolated subnets, no NAT"]
            Auth
            Api
            Proc[Lambda: documentProcessor]
            S3GW[S3 gateway endpoint]
            DDBGW[DynamoDB gateway endpoint]
            APIEP[API Gateway interface endpoint]
        end

        Auth --> DDBGW
        Api --> S3GW
        Api --> DDBGW
        Proc --> S3GW
        Proc --> DDBGW
        S3GW --> S3[(S3 bucket, KMS)]
        DDBGW --> Keys[(DynamoDB: api-keys)]
        DDBGW --> Docs[(DynamoDB: documents)]
        S3 -->|ObjectCreated documents/| Proc
        Proc -.->|on failure| DLQ[SQS dead-letter queue]
        Proc -.->|errors, duration| CW[CloudWatch alarms]
    end
